OL,3,AWoman racially abused at work by boys
OL,4,Aawarded #15k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA black council worker who was
OL,7,Fsubjected to "serious racial abuse" and
OL,8,Ffaced with "dismissive" managers after
OL,9,Fshe complained has been awarded
OL,10,F#15,000.
OL,12,FThe woman was an intervention worker in
OL,13,FWest Berkshire Council's Youth Justice
OL,14,FSupport Team when two boys inflicted
OL,15,Fthe abuse in April 2024.
OL,17,FAn employment tribunal in the summer
OL,18,Fwas told authority managers inferred to
OL,19,Fthe woman that "absorbing that kind of
OL,20,Fabuse simply 'went with the
OL,21,Fterritory'".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
